# More Good Reviews MCP setup (Cursor)

The plugin `mcp.json` includes **only one** HTTP MCP (`https://api.moregoodreviews.com/mcp`). Cursor cannot bundle a different URL per user from the plugin alone. **Additional URLs are normal:** users add them in **Settings → Tools & MCP → Add new MCP server**.

## Bundled project MCP (start here)

1. **Settings → Tools & MCP** — enable **more-good-reviews** from the plugin.
2. **Sign in** / OAuth → approve scopes. Generic host may prompt for project at consent.

## Add scoped project MCP (agencies, white-label, fixed project)

1. MGR: project **Settings → MCP Server** → copy full **MCP Server URL** (`…/mcp/p/…`).
2. Cursor: **Settings → Tools & MCP** → **Add new MCP server** → HTTP → paste URL → name it (client name) → **Sign in**.

Repeat for each client business. Reputation skills need **project** MCP; ask which client if several are connected.

## Add agency MCP (optional admin)

1. MGR: **Agency → MCP Server** → copy full URL (`…/mcp/a/…`).
2. Cursor: **Add new MCP server** → paste → **Sign in**.

Do **not** use agency MCP for `listReviews`, customers, or review requests for a client—use that client’s **project** URL.

## After connecting

Use reputation skills or slash commands when at least one **project** MCP is connected and authorized.
